{"id":188,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と自立を育む宮教大附属中学校","feature_description":"宮城教育大学附属中学校は、自ら考え行動し、共に学び合い、高め合う生徒の育成を掲げています。学校生活では運動・文化あわせて12のサークル活動が火曜を除いて行われ、学習と自治を両立する校風が確認できました。大学附属校らしく、探究の姿勢を重視する点も特徴です。 さらに、大学附属校として教育研究に協力しつつ、日々のサークル活動を通じて仲間と学び合う姿勢が育まれています。","clubs":[{"id":3414,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3415,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3416,"name":"陸上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3417,"name":"テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3418,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3419,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3420,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3421,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3422,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3423,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3424,"name":"科学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3425,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":2692,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://fu-cyuu.miyakyo-u.ac.jp/about-schoo